2. **Regulatory Reporting:** Expedited report submitted to the Pharmacovigilance Programme of India (PvPI) / Central Drugs Standard Control Organization (CDSCO) via the ADR Monitoring Centre (AMC) Vigiflow portal within the mandatory 15-calendar-day window.
